---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import avatar from '../assets/nishat.png';

const schema = {
	'@context': 'https://schema.org',
	'@type': 'Person',
	'@id': 'https://nishat.blog/#nishat',
	name: 'Nishat Shahriyar',
	alternateName: ['Nish', 'Redwanul Karim Chowdhury'],
	description:
		'Nishat Shahriyar leads marketing for Fluent Forms, Ninja Tables, and FluentPlayer at WPManageNinja (AuthLab). He writes the WP More newsletter.',
	jobTitle: 'Senior Product Marketing Lead',
	image: new URL(avatar.src, Astro.site).href,
	url: 'https://nishat.blog',
	mainEntityOfPage: 'https://nishat.blog/about/',
	address: {
		'@type': 'PostalAddress',
		addressLocality: 'Sylhet',
		addressCountry: 'BD',
	},
	worksFor: {
		'@type': 'Organization',
		name: 'WPManageNinja',
		url: 'https://wpmanageninja.com',
		parentOrganization: {
			'@type': 'Organization',
			name: 'AuthLab',
		},
	},
	knowsAbout: [
		'WordPress',
		'WordPress community',
		'Product marketing',
		'Marketing systems',
		'Marketing strategy',
		'SEO',
		'Content marketing',
		'Newsletters',
		'Creator economy',
		'AI-assisted marketing',
	],
	knowsLanguage: ['en', 'bn'],
	sameAs: [
		'https://profiles.wordpress.org/rednishat/',
		'https://github.com/rednishat',
		'https://x.com/rednishat',
		'https://www.linkedin.com/in/nishatshahriyar/',
		'https://bsky.app/profile/rednishat.bsky.social',
		'https://rednishat.medium.com',
		'https://www.youtube.com/@WPMore',
		'https://www.youtube.com/@LearnWithNish',
		'https://wpmore.net',
		'https://serplabseo.com',
		'https://nishishere.com',
		'https://nishnama.com',
		'https://www.nichenish.com/',
	],
};
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="I'm Nishat. I write about WordPress SaaS marketing, systems thinking, and what it actually takes to grow a product team from the inside." />
		<script is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<div class="about-header">
				<Image src={avatar} alt="Nishat Shahriyar" class="avatar" width={120} height={120} />
				<h1>About</h1>
			</div>
			<div class="prose">
				<p>
					I’m Nishat Shahriyar, Senior Product Marketing Lead at WPManageNinja (AuthLab). I write about WordPress SaaS marketing, systems thinking, and what it actually
					takes to grow a product team from the inside.
				</p>

				<p>
					For the past five years I've worked at <a href="https://wpmanageninja.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WPManageNinja</a>,
					the company behind Fluent Forms, FluentCRM, Ninja Tables, Fluent Support, FluentCommunity, FluentCart,
					FluentPlayer, Paymattic, and FluentBooking. I work from Sylhet, Bangladesh. I started as a Digital Marketer in 2021, moved into
					Marketing Lead, then led a content team and ran product marketing for Fluent Support (now 10K users).
					Now I own marketing for Fluent Forms (800K users), Ninja Tables (70K users), and FluentPlayer
					(newly launched, 2000+ users and growing) — running content, SEO, lifecycle email, and AI-augmented workflows for a
					five-person team.
				</p>

				<p>
					That's the day job. This blog is where I write down what I've actually learned doing it: the
					systems, the mistakes, the stuff that worked because it was boring and repeatable, not because
					it was clever.
				</p>

				<p>
					I'm also active in the WordPress community. I run 4 newsletters: <a href="https://wpmore.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener"> WP More</a> for WordPress & WP community news,
				    <a href="https://serplabseo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"> HighDegree* Marketing</a> for SEO, AI and marketing updates,
					a personal curated one on tech, creator economy, pop culture and business at <a href="https://nishishere.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Weekly Nishishere</a>,
					and a blog <a href="https://nishnama.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Nishnama</a>, where I write in
					Bangla, my native language. I also started documenting my hobby projects at <a href="https://nichenish.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NicheNish</a>, the goal is to share what i am learing and creating.
				</p>

				<p>
					Most of what shows up here sits at the intersection of WordPress, SEO, AI-augmented content
					systems, and personal branding — partly because that's my job, and partly because most
					marketing advice for SaaS companies skips the operational layer that actually makes it work.
				</p>

				<p>
					This blog also doubles as a journal — thoughts and opinions on life, marriage, raising a kid,
					work, and whatever else I find interesting at the time.
				</p>

				<p>
					Short version: I build content systems for WordPress products, and I'm trying to get better
					at explaining how, in public.
				</p>

					<h2>By the numbers</h2>
					<ul>
						<li>Fluent Forms: 300K – 800K users (and growing). Fluent Support: product launch, 1K – 5K users in one year (now 10k users).</li>
						<li><a href="https://wpmore.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WP More</a>: from 316 to 1,000+ subscribers on Substack in two months.</li>
						<li><a href="https://nishishere.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NishIsHere</a>: 100+ issues and 1,900+ subscribers.</li>
						<li><a href="https://nichenish.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NicheNish</a>: recently started documenting my hobby projects.</li>

						<li><a href="https://nishnama.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NishNama</a>: 11,000+ subscribers on its Bangla email list.</li>
						<li>A five-person content team, and 4 newsletters published alongside the day job.</li>
					</ul>

					<h2>Writing &amp; contributions</h2>
					<p>Where I write outside this blog:</p>
					<ul>
						<li><a href="https://wpmore.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WP More</a> — WordPress and community news, with a Substack and Medium version.</li>
						<li><a href="https://serplabseo.com/subscribe-highdegree/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HighDegree* Marketing</a> — SEO, AI and social media, also on LinkedIn.</li>
						<li><a href="https://nishishere.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NishIsHere</a> — a weekly curated digest on tech, the creator economy, pop culture and business.</li>
						<li><a href="https://nishnama.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NishNama</a> — my Bangla blog and newsletter.</li>
					</ul>
					<p>New here? Start with these:</p>
					<ul>
						<li><a href="/you-can-just-do-things/">You Can Just Do Things</a></li>
						<li><a href="/how-my-fear-became-my-main-motivator/">How My Fear Become My Main Motivator</a></li>
						<li><a href="/misogi/">Misogi (禊)</a></li>
						<li><a href="/wordcamp-kathmandu-2026-experience/">My WordCamp Kathmandu 2026 experience</a></li>
					</ul>

					<h2>Say hi</h2>
					<p>
						I like meeting people who build things with WordPress, newsletters or content. If that's you, say hi.
						Reply to any of my newsletters, or message me on 
						<a href="https://twitter.com/rednishat" target="_blank" rel="noopener"> X</a> or
						<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nishatshahriyar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"> LinkedIn</a>.
					</p>

					<div class="social">
					<span class="social-label">Follow me</span>
					<a href="https://twitter.com/rednishat" target="_blank" rel="noopener">X</a>
					<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nishatshahriyar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
					<a href="https://bsky.app/profile/rednishat.bsky.social" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bluesky</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.about-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
	}

	.avatar {
		width: 80px;
		height: 80px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		object-fit: cover;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.prose {
		max-width: 600px;
	}

	.prose p {
		margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
		color: var(--text);
	}

	.prose h2 {
		font-size: 1.375rem;
		margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
	}

	.prose ul {
		margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
	}

	.prose li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.prose a {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
	}

	.prose a:hover {
		color: var(--accent-hover);
	}

	.social {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.social-label {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-weight: 500;
		margin-right: 0.25rem;
	}

	.social a {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		text-decoration: none;
		padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: 999px;
		transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
	}

	.social a:hover {
		color: var(--accent);
		border-color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
	}
</style>
